1
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
A little pause... and we are back.

2
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:59,980
A little pause... and we are back.

3
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,100
A little pause... and we are back.

4
00:01:36,614 --> 00:01:38,170
Those are my grandfather's things!

5
00:01:38,310 --> 00:01:39,830
Where do you think you're taking them?

6
00:01:40,869 --> 00:01:44,910
Honorable grandson, we... I
said, where are you taking them?

7
00:01:45,294 --> 00:01:46,730
They belong to my grandfather!

8
00:01:47,810 --> 00:01:51,786
Uh, well, these things...
they're just in the way, you see,

9
00:01:51,787 --> 00:01:54,970
so we thought it would be
best to put them somewhere safe.

10
00:01:55,859 --> 00:01:57,550
What do you mean, just in the way?

11
00:01:58,259 --> 00:02:00,210
You shouldn't even be touching that stuff!

12
00:02:00,330 --> 00:02:01,330
Who gave you permission?

13
00:02:01,999 --> 00:02:04,590
Well, we have to make room for the next
Hokage.

14
00:02:05,889 --> 00:02:06,889
Uh, what?

15
00:02:07,609 --> 00:02:08,930
Yeah, it's done.

16
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,970
The fifth Hokage has finally been chosen.

17
00:02:13,010 --> 00:02:14,810
It's a big relief to the whole village.

18
00:02:16,450 --> 00:02:19,870
Now the one that's been chosen
is moving in, so we have to... No!

19
00:02:20,450 --> 00:02:21,450
No way!

20
00:02:21,630 --> 00:02:23,390
It's too soon for a new Hokage!

21
00:02:24,390 --> 00:02:26,790
My grandfather was everything to this
village!

22
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,280
Seven.

23
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:03,940
There are seven birds within fifty meters
of pillar number two.

24
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,740
What do you want, Tenten?

25
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,200
Neji!

26
00:03:13,625 --> 00:03:14,905
Hey, haven't you heard the news?

27
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:16,440
Lady Tsunade's returned!

28
00:03:17,830 --> 00:03:18,830
It's really her!

29
00:03:18,940 --> 00:03:20,120
Don't you want to see her?

30
00:03:21,795 --> 00:03:22,795
No, not really.

31
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:24,620
Not right now.

32
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:26,100
Huh?

33
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:29,060
Hmm.

34
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:31,180
There were eight birds.

35
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:34,040
Listen carefully, Tenten.

36
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:37,080
Lady Tsunade, we must send
word to the Feudal Lord that

37
00:03:37,081 --> 00:03:39,820
the fifth Hokage has
officially arrived in the village.

38
00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:44,520
All the preparations must begin at once
for the installation ceremony.

39
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,360
Can't we just skip the ceremonies?

40
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,920
They're such a bore.

41
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:53,740
Okay, it comes with the job, I guess.

42
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,000
One of the perks of being Hokage.

43
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,440
Genma.

44
00:03:57,620 --> 00:03:58,160
Here.

45
00:03:58,300 --> 00:03:58,640
Alba.

46
00:03:58,920 --> 00:03:59,920
Here.

47
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:01,860
Send out the word.

48
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,480
Send out the word.

49
00:04:03,481 --> 00:04:06,122
The village must be made
aware that in a few days

50
00:04:06,123 --> 00:04:09,340
from now, we will officially
welcome the fifth hokage.

51
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:10,720
Okay.

52
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:12,700
I hate all this.

53
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,640
My body's sore and stiff.

54
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:19,060
All I want is to sit down and relax with a
nice hot cup of tea.

55
00:04:19,459 --> 00:04:21,440
Yes, but lady... Not
so fast, grandma!

56
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,412
Before you start sucking
down some tea, isn't

57
00:04:23,413 --> 00:04:26,141
there something
you're forgetting about?

58
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:27,740
What would that be?

59
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,820
Come on!

60
00:04:28,821 --> 00:04:29,700
Are you kidding me?

61
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:32,900
What about Kakashi-sensei and Sasuke and
Bushi-brow?

62
00:04:32,901 --> 00:04:35,100
Oh yeah, I did forget about them.

63
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:37,500
Well, if it isn't Naruto.

64
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,000
Hmm?

65
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,080
Shikamaru?

66
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,340
What are you doing here?

67
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:43,340
Shouldn't you be somewhere stuffing your
face?

68
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:44,560
How about you?

69
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:46,720
You're usually still asleep this time of
day.

70
00:04:47,020 --> 00:04:47,820
Very funny.

71
00:04:47,980 --> 00:04:50,780
My dad asked me to come along with him,
but don't ask me why.

72
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:51,300
Hmm?

73
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:53,480
Hey, do they know each other?

74
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:55,620
Greetings, Lady Tsunade.

75
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,720
It's been a long time.

76
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,680
You're that kid from the Nara family.

77
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:01,360
Hope you're still taking good care of the
deer.

78
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,880
I made a lot of money.

79
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:04,540
I got good medicine out of those antlers.

80
00:05:04,580 --> 00:05:06,540
Oh yes, the deer are fine.

81
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:08,160
Who's the blonde girl?

82
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:11,060
And why is she talking to my dad like
she's his boss?

83
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:12,240
Didn't you hear?

84
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:13,440
She's the fifth Hokage.

85
00:05:13,740 --> 00:05:13,860
Huh?

86
00:05:14,740 --> 00:05:16,060
And she's no girl.

87
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:18,320
She's actually an old lady in her fifties.

88
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:18,620
Huh?

89
00:05:19,300 --> 00:05:21,100
I'll see you again soon, no doubt.

90
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:22,400
Yes, my lady.

91
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,400
So long.

92
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,740
We're going to the infirmary.

93
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:26,980
I'll catch you later, Shikamaru.

94
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,700
I'll show you the killer new technique I
picked up.

95
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,820
That's really the fifth Hokage?

96
00:05:32,821 --> 00:05:34,560
Watch it, Shikamaru.

97
00:05:35,540 --> 00:05:38,700
That woman is one of the strongest ninja
you'll ever meet.

98
00:05:38,995 --> 00:05:40,700
Don't let her good looks fool you.

99
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:41,960
Yeah?

100
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:46,340
After all, there's a reason she's the only
female among the legendary Sannin.

101
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:50,240
Okay... but I mean a woman, Hokage?

102
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:54,040
Not to sound prejudiced or anything,
but is that such a good idea?

103
00:05:55,094 --> 00:05:56,094
Hmm...

104
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:58,020
Come on, you know what they're like.

105
00:05:58,350 --> 00:05:59,720
You can never figure them out.

106
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:02,040
You never know where you stand with them.

107
00:06:02,041 --> 00:06:04,720
The smallest things can put you on their
bad side.

108
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:07,053
And always playing their
little mind games with

109
00:06:07,054 --> 00:06:09,861
you, trying to get you
to do what they want.

110
00:06:10,030 --> 00:06:11,800
They're just a big pain, basically.

111
00:06:12,980 --> 00:06:13,980
Hmm...

112
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:15,880
Listen, Shikamaru.

113
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,120
Hmm?

114
00:06:16,730 --> 00:06:20,020
Keep in mind that without women,
you and I wouldn't even exist.

115
00:06:21,030 --> 00:06:25,240
And take my word for it, they make men
better people than we'd ever be without them.

116
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:30,641
Unlike us, even the strongest of them isn't
afraid to be gentle with the man she loves.

117
00:06:31,650 --> 00:06:33,520
It's funny to hear him talking like this.

118
00:06:34,145 --> 00:06:36,640
Tied to Mom's apron strings the way he is.

119
00:06:39,180 --> 00:06:41,380
Someday you'll understand what I'm talking
about.

120
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,640
Oh, we better hurry up.

121
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,020
Let's finish up our business here and get
back.

122
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:49,080
You know how your mother will chew us out
if we're late.

123
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:50,860
Come on, Shikamaru.

124
00:07:00,910 --> 00:07:01,910
May I come in?

125
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,350
Who are you?

126
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:11,390
Whoever she is, she's beautiful.

127
00:07:11,930 --> 00:07:12,470
Sakura!

128
00:07:12,670 --> 00:07:13,670
Sakura!

129
00:07:14,030 --> 00:07:15,150
You'll never believe it!

130
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:17,070
She's gonna make everything okay again!

131
00:07:18,890 --> 00:07:21,150
Don't worry, Sasuke's gonna be all right
now.

132
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:24,390
Naruto...

133
00:07:27,940 --> 00:07:29,860
Those flowers weren't picked the same day.

134
00:07:31,460 --> 00:07:33,920
Looks like she's been visiting him for a
while now.

135
00:07:35,020 --> 00:07:37,340
You must be the one Gai-sensei told me
about.

136
00:07:38,130 --> 00:07:43,060
Oh, please, if you can save
Sasuke... Well, I'll see what I can do.

137
00:08:21,370 --> 00:08:22,370
Sasuke!

138
00:08:23,135 --> 00:08:24,210
Oh, Sasuke!

139
00:08:34,650 --> 00:08:35,650
Sasuke!

140
00:08:36,590 --> 00:08:38,450
Hey, you're back!

141
00:08:39,150 --> 00:08:40,150
Huh?

142
00:08:40,830 --> 00:08:41,830
Huh?

143
00:08:41,929 --> 00:08:42,929
Huh?

144
00:08:43,090 --> 00:08:43,429
Huh?

145
00:08:43,530 --> 00:08:44,530
Huh?

146
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:45,670
Huh?

147
00:09:02,210 --> 00:09:03,210
ması Hm.

148
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:09,840
The little tough guy has a soft spot,
I see.

149
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:12,700
Come on!

150
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:13,800
You're not done!

151
00:09:16,565 --> 00:09:17,565
We're done!

152
00:09:17,740 --> 00:09:18,740
Disgraceful.

153
00:09:19,939 --> 00:09:23,540
To be taken completely out of the game by
two low-life punks like that...

154
00:09:23,939 --> 00:09:26,340
I thought you were supposed to be the
best.

155
00:09:28,109 --> 00:09:29,800
Sorry to disappoint you.

156
00:09:31,234 --> 00:09:33,040
Okay, that's Kakashi-sensei!

157
00:09:33,041 --> 00:09:35,180
Now just one more and you're all done!

158
00:09:35,540 --> 00:09:36,080
Ruck Lee!

159
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:37,180
He's right next door!

160
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,240
Next door!

161
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:41,840
LEE!

162
00:09:43,539 --> 00:09:44,640
Look who's here to see you!

163
00:09:44,979 --> 00:09:46,040
It's Lady Tsunade!

164
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:59,060
Is this one of your students, guy?

165
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,400
Yes!

166
00:10:00,764 --> 00:10:02,720
He's more than a student, he's like a son.

167
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:04,940
I see.

168
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:07,820
Naruto.

169
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:08,620
Huh?

170
00:10:09,074 --> 00:10:11,460
Do you really have time to be dawdling
around here?

171
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,320
You're right!

172
00:10:13,614 --> 00:10:16,120
I almost forgot I'm supposed to meet
Iruka-sensei!

173
00:10:16,719 --> 00:10:17,719
Better run along.

174
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:18,860
Right!

175
00:10:18,994 --> 00:10:20,280
I'll let you take it from here!

176
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:21,660
All right!

177
00:10:25,619 --> 00:10:26,950
Hey there, Naruto!

178
00:10:27,709 --> 00:10:28,990
Finally, Iruka-sensei!

179
00:10:28,991 --> 00:10:29,550
Where you been?

180
00:10:29,890 --> 00:10:30,890
I'm late, sorry.

181
00:10:31,309 --> 00:10:33,430
It's all the preparations for the fifth
Hokage.

182
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,550
Well, okay, whatever.

183
00:10:41,409 --> 00:10:44,680
No one will hold it against you if you
give up on being a shinobi.

184
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:45,900
But... but you're not serious!

185
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:45,900
You're exaggerating, right, Lady Tsunade?

186
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:45,900
Huh?

187
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,200
Huh?

188
00:10:51,060 --> 00:10:53,040
But... but you're not serious!

189
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,500
You're exaggerating, right, Lady Tsunade?

190
00:10:55,501 --> 00:10:56,501
Huh?

191
00:10:56,540 --> 00:10:57,000
But you're not serious!

192
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:57,000
You're exaggerating, right, Lady Tsunade?

193
00:10:57,219 --> 00:11:01,260
His injuries have left numerous bone
fragments embedded in his spinal column.

194
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:03,860
It's a miracle he can still move at all.

195
00:11:05,620 --> 00:11:09,320
He's physically incapable of carrying out
the duties of a shinobi.

196
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:12,140
This is some kind of test, right?

197
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,740
You don't really mean that.

198
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:15,700
Even if I were able to operate...

199
00:11:16,140 --> 00:11:17,420
Don't listen to her, Lee!

200
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:19,420
That's not Lady Tsunade!

201
00:11:19,580 --> 00:11:20,480
It's an impostor!

202
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:24,280
It's some kind of demon that's transformed
itself to look like her!

203
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:25,400
Who are you?!

204
00:11:25,401 --> 00:11:25,460
You!

205
00:11:25,461 --> 00:11:26,461
What do you want?

206
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:41,120
So I have no chance?

207
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,880
It is hopeless?

208
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:46,760
No one but me could even attempt the
operation.

209
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:51,120
But even with my skills, the risks would
be enormous.

210
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:53,920
What risks?

211
00:11:53,921 --> 00:11:58,540
The chances of it being successful are
50-50 at best.

212
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:00,720
And if it should fail...

213
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,040
He'll die.

214
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:18,240
I will never give up, Gai-sensei!

215
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:20,180
I will be back stronger than ever!

216
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,980
This is horrible, Gai-sensei!

217
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,920
Why are you making me eat this?

218
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:31,040
They're very rare Chinese herbal medicine
balls.

219
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:34,400
I'm told that eating 100 or so should heal
your injuries.

220
00:12:34,660 --> 00:12:36,520
Then I do not care what they taste like!

221
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,740
I will eat them all!

222
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:38,860
Whatever it takes!

223
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:44,560
I don't think they met all of them in one
day!

224
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:48,640
It's best if you give up being a shinobi.

225
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:50,100
Find a different path.

226
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,600
Lee...

227
00:13:16,849 --> 00:13:20,500
If I had known you were gonna do this,
I would have never let you see them.

228
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:21,740
Don't say that!

229
00:13:23,429 --> 00:13:24,740
I understand your pain.

230
00:13:25,379 --> 00:13:27,600
Believe me, I get no pleasure from this.

231
00:13:28,809 --> 00:13:31,380
But he needs to know the truth,
and to know it now.

232
00:13:33,249 --> 00:13:34,520
A choice has to be made.

233
00:13:35,624 --> 00:13:37,580
Putting it off won't make it any easier.

234
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:56,360
I want to show I can be a splendid ninja
as well!

235
00:13:56,760 --> 00:14:00,100
Even if I do not have ninjutsu or
genjutsu!

236
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:02,640
I want to prove it to the whole world!

237
00:14:14,860 --> 00:14:15,980
That's enough now!

238
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:18,240
We don't want to have to break it down!

239
00:14:18,724 --> 00:14:19,860
Go ahead and try it!

240
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:20,880
See what happens!

241
00:14:20,959 --> 00:14:22,840
I'm the grandson of the third Hokage!

242
00:14:23,349 --> 00:14:25,660
If you go against me, you're going against
my...

243
00:14:28,765 --> 00:14:29,800
My grandpa...

244
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:32,560
You'll be going against the Hokage!

245
00:14:33,609 --> 00:14:37,760
Lady Tsunade has important work to do and
she can't do it until she gets in there.

246
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:52,020
Pepper's full of bombs!

247
00:14:52,180 --> 00:14:54,360
And you'll get worse if you try coming in!

248
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:56,240
The whole place is booby-trapped!

249
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:59,760
Venerable grandson, even you...

250
00:15:00,889 --> 00:15:03,620
There are some things even you can't get
away with!

251
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,720
Now come out of there!

252
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:05,960
Shut up and go away!

253
00:15:09,084 --> 00:15:11,080
Isn't it a little early for all this
racket?

254
00:15:11,584 --> 00:15:13,080
It's giving me a screaming headache.

255
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,960
Lady Tsunade... Lady Tsunade...

256
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,060
Huh?

257
00:15:19,359 --> 00:15:21,160
You two can't handle one little kid?

258
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:23,020
Well...

259
00:15:23,649 --> 00:15:24,780
Get him out of there!

260
00:15:28,839 --> 00:15:31,300
But ma'am, he's the grandson of the third
Hokage!

261
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:32,200
What do I care?

262
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:34,220
I'm the granddaughter of the first Hokage!

263
00:15:34,624 --> 00:15:36,260
I'm the one you need to worry about now!

264
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:42,320
From what I can see, it might do the brat
some good to be roughed up a little.

265
00:15:42,629 --> 00:15:43,800
Now get him out of there!

266
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:45,120
Right.

267
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:48,840
Wait!

268
00:15:48,841 --> 00:15:49,240
Don't!

269
00:15:49,540 --> 00:15:49,780
Wait!

270
00:15:49,780 --> 00:15:49,780
Don't!

271
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:51,020
Tamaruto...

272
00:15:52,690 --> 00:15:53,420
Hold on.

273
00:15:53,540 --> 00:15:54,700
Just wait a second.

274
00:15:55,234 --> 00:15:58,760
I don't know exactly what's going on here,
but don't be too rough on Konohamaru, huh?

275
00:15:59,059 --> 00:16:00,220
Please, Grandma Tsunade!

276
00:16:00,989 --> 00:16:02,260
He's a friend of yours, is he?

277
00:16:02,540 --> 00:16:03,540
Mm-hmm.

278
00:16:05,139 --> 00:16:06,560
Don't worry, I can get him out!

279
00:16:06,879 --> 00:16:08,080
Just let me talk to him!

280
00:16:08,140 --> 00:16:09,140
He'll listen to me!

281
00:16:09,279 --> 00:16:11,360
I want him out of there by the end of the
day!

282
00:16:13,060 --> 00:16:14,060
End of the day?

283
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:15,780
But... Lady Tsunade!

284
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:16,980
Wait!

285
00:16:22,569 --> 00:16:23,610
Look at this place.

286
00:16:23,890 --> 00:16:25,850
Not a single gambling hall anywhere.

287
00:16:26,469 --> 00:16:28,149
Well, you don't have time for that anyway.

288
00:16:28,484 --> 00:16:30,364
There's an awful lot of work waiting to be
done.

289
00:16:30,780 --> 00:16:31,870
Nowhere to gamble.

290
00:16:32,199 --> 00:16:33,199
Or get a drink.

291
00:16:33,939 --> 00:16:36,050
What a boring little dump a Leaf Village
is.

292
00:16:36,249 --> 00:16:37,249
It's no fun at all.

293
00:16:37,730 --> 00:16:39,650
Just like the third Hokage.

294
00:16:40,010 --> 00:16:41,010
Lady Tsunade!

295
00:16:41,529 --> 00:16:43,130
Oh, I'm exhausted.

296
00:16:43,490 --> 00:16:46,130
I just want to sit down and have a drink
somewhere.

297
00:16:46,131 --> 00:16:48,270
Isn't that too much to ask?

298
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:50,640
Huh?

299
00:16:51,989 --> 00:16:52,990
If that's what you want.

300
00:16:53,499 --> 00:16:55,564
If it's absolutely
necessary, I'll find you a

301
00:16:55,664 --> 00:16:57,470
place where you can
have a drink, all right?

302
00:16:57,750 --> 00:16:58,350
Really?

303
00:16:58,730 --> 00:16:59,730
Really?

304
00:16:59,989 --> 00:17:02,630
But only if you promise to get to work.

305
00:17:05,810 --> 00:17:06,410
Hm.

306
00:17:06,809 --> 00:17:08,030
Eight D-rank missions.

307
00:17:08,869 --> 00:17:10,050
Three C-rank missions.

308
00:17:10,909 --> 00:17:12,770
Exactly like Kurenai's own team.

309
00:17:16,359 --> 00:17:19,069
It's not hard to see what the third Hokage
was thinking.

310
00:17:22,664 --> 00:17:26,349
This squad is a mirror image of their
parents' team.

311
00:17:28,970 --> 00:17:29,970
I see.

312
00:17:31,869 --> 00:17:34,410
Oh, look how well-balanced this squad is.

313
00:17:34,869 --> 00:17:37,010
Each member with his or her own specialty.

314
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:58,854
If we can't support them,
no matter how tough it

315
00:17:58,855 --> 00:18:00,280
gets, he can't imagined
having a job in high school.

316
00:18:00,281 --> 00:18:00,380
Boy, is that a cost to you still Wow
that's a surprise coming from the outside,

317
00:18:00,740 --> 00:18:00,740
ah, ok.

318
00:18:00,741 --> 00:18:01,000
I'll help you find more key.

319
00:18:01,001 --> 00:18:01,040
Listen.

320
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,840
This strengthened my brain, right?

321
00:18:13,100 --> 00:18:14,100
Nature.

322
00:18:46,814 --> 00:18:48,400
Now I've officially had it!

323
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:49,640
Game's over, kid!

324
00:18:50,079 --> 00:18:52,376
With my new powers, I
can easily blast those doors

325
00:18:52,377 --> 00:18:54,580
down, though I was hoping
not to have to use them!

326
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,760
You're too much help!

327
00:18:58,499 --> 00:18:59,499
Grandma Tsunade!

328
00:19:00,514 --> 00:19:01,514
Wait, be careful!

329
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:15,920
Oh, no!

330
00:19:16,180 --> 00:19:17,180
Oh!

331
00:19:17,540 --> 00:19:18,100
Oh!

332
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:18,400
Oh!

333
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:19,080
Oh!

334
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:19,340
Oh!

335
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:19,740
Oh!

336
00:19:19,980 --> 00:19:20,980
Oh!

337
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:21,160
Oh!

338
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:23,100
Oh!

339
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,200
Oh!

340
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:08,030
I should have never let her out of my
sight for a minute.

341
00:20:08,031 --> 00:20:09,070
Oh...

342
00:20:11,034 --> 00:20:12,034
Oink!

343
00:20:12,389 --> 00:20:14,090
O-O-Oink!

344
00:20:14,930 --> 00:20:17,090
Lead me to her, Ton-Ton!

345
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:31,630
Lead me to her, Ton-Ton!

346
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:34,931
Revitalizing the cellular structure...
Revitalizing the cellular structure... Huh...

347
00:20:42,514 --> 00:20:43,514
Aha!

348
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:44,560
So there you are!

349
00:20:44,660 --> 00:20:45,320
We caught you.

350
00:20:45,540 --> 00:20:46,540
Shhh!

351
00:20:50,090 --> 00:20:52,670
Lady Tsunade, are you actually studying?

352
00:20:52,930 --> 00:20:53,530
Oink!

353
00:20:53,531 --> 00:20:55,270
Be quiet, will you?

354
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:56,970
I'm trying to concentrate here.

355
00:20:57,710 --> 00:20:59,610
What did you say?!

356
00:20:59,611 --> 00:21:03,230
You've never concentrated on anything but
gambling!

357
00:21:03,890 --> 00:21:03,990
Huh?

358
00:21:04,454 --> 00:21:05,730
That sounded like Shizune.

359
00:21:06,539 --> 00:21:07,630
Oh, just calm down.

360
00:21:10,849 --> 00:21:13,390
I was thinking about that medical ninja,
Kabuto.

361
00:21:13,590 --> 00:21:13,950
Remember?

362
00:21:14,574 --> 00:21:15,970
What about him?

363
00:21:16,739 --> 00:21:19,730
Specifically, his body's ability to create
new cells.

364
00:21:20,639 --> 00:21:23,170
If I could apply that technique to a
patient...

365
00:21:24,639 --> 00:21:26,110
You mean Rock Lee, don't you?

366
00:21:26,929 --> 00:21:32,970
Even if it only increases his chances from
50 to 51%, I think it may be worth a try.

367
00:21:33,489 --> 00:21:37,811
Lady Tsunade, the success of that technique
depends so much on the person doing it.

368
00:21:38,369 --> 00:21:40,790
There's no guarantee that you'd be able to
pull it off.

369
00:21:44,939 --> 00:21:46,540
Only one way to find out.

370
00:21:48,199 --> 00:21:51,220
I mean, I am the fifth Hokage,
after all.

371
00:21:51,580 --> 00:21:52,580
Oh...

372
00:21:59,050 --> 00:22:01,370
There's no way out of it, Konohamaru.

373
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,550
I must go.

374
00:22:03,430 --> 00:22:06,150
I am the third Hokage, after all.

375
00:22:06,530 --> 00:22:09,570
If that's what it means to be Hokage,
then quit.

376
00:22:10,610 --> 00:22:13,050
Everyone in this village is family to me.

377
00:22:13,950 --> 00:22:16,990
Protecting the family, that's what it
means to be Hokage.

378
00:22:20,290 --> 00:22:21,290
Wait!

379
00:22:21,450 --> 00:22:22,450
Grandpa!

380
00:22:33,590 --> 00:22:34,590
I can't do this!

381
00:22:35,250 --> 00:22:37,450
Just this once.

382
00:22:37,690 --> 00:22:38,830
I'll make an exception.

383
00:22:40,050 --> 00:22:41,050
Just this once.

384
00:22:43,430 --> 00:22:45,210
Where are we going, Konohamaru?

385
00:22:45,490 --> 00:22:47,970
What's the matter, don't you want to see
Grandma Tsunade?

386
00:22:48,250 --> 00:22:49,250
Nope.

387
00:22:50,550 --> 00:22:51,550
Hmm.

388
00:22:59,560 --> 00:23:02,300
I am the fifth Hokage, after all.

389
00:23:02,520 --> 00:23:04,840
There's no way out of it, Konohamaru.

390
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:07,800
I am the third Hokage, after all.

391
00:23:09,460 --> 00:23:11,160
There's no way out of it.

392
00:23:11,260 --> 00:23:13,360
I'm the honorable grandson, after all.

393
00:23:14,020 --> 00:23:15,020
Huh?

394
00:23:15,060 --> 00:23:18,560
I mean, I'm Konohamaru of the Leaf
Village!

395
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:19,700
Hey!

396
00:23:19,860 --> 00:23:21,040
Where are you going?

397
00:23:21,260 --> 00:23:22,420
Wait up, Konohamaru!

398
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:24,300
What the heck's gotten into him?

399
00:23:24,740 --> 00:23:24,740
Hey!

400
00:23:25,040 --> 00:23:26,040
Konohamaru!

401
00:23:30,800 --> 00:23:34,140
What is it, Lady Tsunade?

402
00:23:34,300 --> 00:23:35,540
Oh, nothing.

403
00:23:55,030 --> 00:23:55,800
Gojutsu!

404
00:23:55,801 --> 00:23:56,801
Gojutsu!

405
00:24:02,359 --> 00:24:03,590
Transformation Jutsu!

406
00:24:09,634 --> 00:24:10,660
Hey, kid.

407
00:24:10,940 --> 00:24:11,940
Huh?

408
00:24:14,550 --> 00:24:18,000
The glory of youth is in its unbridled
passion.

409
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:22,660
You just keep chippin' away at its sun,
you'll make a splendid shinobi someday.

410
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:28,220
Who is he?

411
00:24:28,300 --> 00:24:29,560
He is so confident!

412
00:24:30,414 --> 00:24:32,980
Grab hold of life by both horns!

413
00:24:33,260 --> 00:24:34,960
That's what youth is for!

414
00:24:35,520 --> 00:24:36,520
Goodbye!

415
00:24:36,900 --> 00:24:37,900
Hahaha!

416
00:24:39,580 --> 00:24:40,580
Huh?

417
00:24:41,764 --> 00:24:43,840
I thought I'd find you here.

418
00:24:45,480 --> 00:24:46,080
Gai!

419
00:24:46,429 --> 00:24:47,429
Gai-sensei!

420
00:24:47,854 --> 00:24:49,374
How did you know where to look for me?

421
00:24:50,009 --> 00:24:51,660
I know everything about you, Lee.

422
00:24:56,759 --> 00:24:59,390
I hear you've been skipping out on your
physical therapy.

423
00:24:59,590 --> 00:25:00,810
You know better.

424
00:25:11,049 --> 00:25:14,039
Back when I first made
genin, I swore I would

425
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:17,631
realize my every dream
right here on this spot.

426
00:25:20,689 --> 00:25:21,689
I swore.

427
00:25:22,349 --> 00:25:24,070
And Neji laughed at me back then.

428
00:25:24,714 --> 00:25:26,270
But I meant every word of it.

429
00:25:28,830 --> 00:25:31,210
I am going to be a splendid ninja as well!

430
00:25:31,650 --> 00:25:34,650
Even if I do not have any ninjutsu or
genjutsu!

431
00:25:35,330 --> 00:25:37,570
I want to prove it to the whole world!

432
00:25:38,610 --> 00:25:42,551
I remember you told me that
with the right amount of passion

433
00:25:42,552 --> 00:25:46,650
and some healthy competition,
we would all be great ninja.

434
00:25:47,914 --> 00:25:50,910
And to make it happen, we would have to
work for it.

435
00:25:53,530 --> 00:25:55,410
I knew I could do it.

436
00:25:57,250 --> 00:25:58,250
Transform!

437
00:26:00,690 --> 00:26:05,150
Back in the academy, there was not a
single person, sensei or student,

438
00:26:05,809 --> 00:26:07,310
who said that kind of thing to me.

439
00:26:15,420 --> 00:26:15,920
I understood him.

440
00:26:15,921 --> 00:26:17,160
Your words were a relief.

441
00:26:17,580 --> 00:26:21,900
Just as I was starting to feel lost,
you lifted the fog from my eyes.

442
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:23,640
I knew.

443
00:26:23,780 --> 00:26:25,900
All I had to do was work harder.

444
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:30,220
You're the girl I was looking for.

445
00:26:34,860 --> 00:26:36,340
I've never seen anyone like you,
Neji.

446
00:26:38,280 --> 00:26:39,140
Everyone knows who I am.

447
00:26:39,141 --> 00:26:42,191
When I said that hard work
was no match against true

448
00:26:42,192 --> 00:26:45,220
genius, you told me I
was a genius of hard work.

449
00:26:47,920 --> 00:26:50,660
Thanks to you and your
encouragement, I've finally

450
00:26:50,661 --> 00:26:53,120
learned the importance
of believing in myself.

451
00:26:57,840 --> 00:27:02,340
The chances of surgery being successful
are 50-50 at best, and if it fails,

452
00:27:02,500 --> 00:27:03,500
he'll die.

453
00:27:09,940 --> 00:27:12,480
But... but it is not the same this time.

454
00:27:12,680 --> 00:27:15,647
Even if I believe in
myself and try as hard as I

455
00:27:15,648 --> 00:27:18,101
can, it will not make
the slightest difference!

456
00:27:21,620 --> 00:27:24,880
Gai-sensei, please tell me what to do!

457
00:27:28,300 --> 00:27:29,820
Tell me, Gai-sensei.

458
00:27:29,821 --> 00:27:32,640
Do you think maybe I can follow in your
footsteps someday?

459
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:36,380
How come I am the only one being punished
like this?

460
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,980
I have my own dreams to protect.

461
00:27:39,140 --> 00:27:41,000
I do not care if it means dying.

462
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:43,700
I follow my ninjo, my ninja way!

463
00:27:44,420 --> 00:27:46,880
Tell me, what should I do?

464
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,880
The Eight Inner Gates.

465
00:27:49,340 --> 00:27:52,080
A forbidden jutsu one can die using.

466
00:27:53,060 --> 00:27:54,380
What do I do?

467
00:27:55,380 --> 00:27:57,180
I am prepared for the worst.

468
00:27:57,280 --> 00:28:00,940
Teach me the forbidden jutsu, whatever it
takes for my dream!

469
00:28:04,080 --> 00:28:06,160
That means everything to me!

470
00:28:19,879 --> 00:28:21,280
The time is right.

471
00:28:22,320 --> 00:28:23,860
Head for the Leaf Village.

472
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:25,440
Now.

473
00:28:38,579 --> 00:28:39,580
You're going to be okay.

474
00:28:40,139 --> 00:28:42,420
You know, your injury could have been much
more serious.

475
00:28:44,644 --> 00:28:45,980
Naruto was relieved, too.

476
00:28:50,610 --> 00:28:51,610
So, uh...

477
00:28:51,779 --> 00:28:53,110
You must be hungry, Sasuke.

478
00:28:53,639 --> 00:28:55,319
Is there something special you want to
eat?

479
00:28:55,649 --> 00:28:57,750
Well, I'll go pick something up for you.

480
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:06,120
To be honest with you, I don't know what
to do.

481
00:29:06,121 --> 00:29:10,254
With the final exam being
suspended, it was the opinion of

482
00:29:10,255 --> 00:29:12,961
many that none of the students
should pass this time around.

483
00:29:13,859 --> 00:29:14,880
And that includes you.

484
00:29:17,789 --> 00:29:19,251
However, I hear that
the Third Hokage had

485
00:29:19,252 --> 00:29:22,261
nothing but the highest
praise for your match.

486
00:29:22,509 --> 00:29:24,940
It seems he meant to recommend you for
Chunin.

487
00:29:27,219 --> 00:29:31,440
In fact, all those who observed the fight
and your proctors felt the same.

488
00:29:32,789 --> 00:29:35,380
So, in this case, my opinion doesn't
really matter.

489
00:29:35,381 --> 00:29:37,898
From this day forth, I
hope you will strive to

490
00:29:37,899 --> 00:29:40,760
achieve a level of excellence
worthy of that headband.

491
00:29:41,460 --> 00:29:42,460
Congratulations.

492
00:29:42,999 --> 00:29:45,120
As of this moment, you stand a Chunin.

493
00:29:47,020 --> 00:29:48,020
Wow!

494
00:29:48,824 --> 00:29:51,171
You know, even a guy
who's as lazy as you are

495
00:29:51,172 --> 00:29:54,341
somehow seems
respectable all of a sudden.

496
00:29:54,600 --> 00:29:56,120
It doesn't suit you.

497
00:29:57,369 --> 00:29:58,500
It's not that funny.

498
00:29:59,159 --> 00:30:01,506
Funny or not, let's have
a toast and celebrate

499
00:30:01,507 --> 00:30:04,120
Shikamaru's outstanding
promotion to Chunin.

500
00:30:04,320 --> 00:30:05,320
Yeah!

501
00:30:05,760 --> 00:30:06,760
Let's eat!

502
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:07,920
Choji, hey!

503
00:30:08,439 --> 00:30:09,600
Lay off of the meat!

504
00:30:09,620 --> 00:30:10,880
We're about to have a toast!

505
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:12,060
Oh, sorry.

506
00:30:12,459 --> 00:30:13,940
I just didn't want it to get burned.

507
00:30:14,829 --> 00:30:16,269
There's plenty of meat for everyone.

508
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:17,060
Dig in.

509
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:18,280
All right!

510
00:30:24,780 --> 00:30:27,240
You're gonna end up in the hospital again,
Choji.

511
00:30:27,669 --> 00:30:30,120
I mean, haven't you ever heard of savoring
your food?

512
00:30:30,340 --> 00:30:31,340
Don't worry.

513
00:30:31,424 --> 00:30:35,460
I figure the more bites I eat, the
more bites I get to savor, right?

514
00:30:37,205 --> 00:30:41,770
Oh, come on, Choji!

515
00:30:41,910 --> 00:30:43,970
That's the last piece of meat,
and I cooked it!

516
00:30:44,190 --> 00:30:45,510
The last piece of meat.

517
00:30:45,670 --> 00:30:47,939
This bite shall be the
most sacred bite of our

518
00:30:47,940 --> 00:30:51,011
entire meal and must be
consumed with utmost care.

519
00:30:51,310 --> 00:30:52,850
So back off, sister.

520
00:30:53,130 --> 00:30:55,550
I'm not handing this morsel over to
anyone.

521
00:30:57,130 --> 00:31:00,150
Why do you have to act like such an
idiot?!

522
00:31:00,151 --> 00:31:00,730
Choji!

523
00:31:01,130 --> 00:31:04,730
Pulling ridiculous stunts like this is why
everyone always makes fun of you!

524
00:31:04,950 --> 00:31:06,050
You are such a fan!

525
00:31:07,139 --> 00:31:08,390
Don't say that word.

526
00:31:08,869 --> 00:31:10,290
And Choji, settle down.

527
00:31:10,954 --> 00:31:12,590
A meal's not the same as a battle.

528
00:31:12,864 --> 00:31:14,130
Stop being such a pain.

529
00:31:14,230 --> 00:31:15,470
We're trying to relax here.

530
00:31:21,210 --> 00:31:22,210
Vulgar.

531
00:31:22,290 --> 00:31:23,290
Short-tempered.

532
00:31:23,990 --> 00:31:24,990
Lazy.

533
00:31:25,684 --> 00:31:27,390
I wonder if these kids are gonna make it.

534
00:31:29,250 --> 00:31:30,250
Particularly.

535
00:31:30,890 --> 00:31:33,270
Choji, you've gotta stop thinking about
food.

536
00:31:33,530 --> 00:31:35,090
Do a little training for once.

537
00:31:37,050 --> 00:31:37,690
Hmm...

538
00:31:37,840 --> 00:32:29,350
Go away.

539
00:32:29,890 --> 00:32:32,190
You don't interest me at the moment.

540
00:32:33,350 --> 00:32:35,690
Naruto is the one you're really after.

541
00:32:43,675 --> 00:32:44,940
Yo, Sakura!

542
00:32:45,260 --> 00:32:46,260
I'm here!

543
00:32:49,610 --> 00:32:50,610
Naruto...

544
00:32:58,619 --> 00:33:00,540
What a peaceful little village.

545
00:33:01,359 --> 00:33:03,120
Can't say much for their security,
though.

546
00:33:04,180 --> 00:33:04,620
Heh.

547
00:33:04,719 --> 00:33:07,040
This village really ought to be taught a
lesson.

548
00:33:07,729 --> 00:33:10,240
We could just stroll right in there and
wipe them all out.

549
00:33:10,574 --> 00:33:12,180
Don't even start, Sakon.

550
00:33:12,600 --> 00:33:13,280
That's right.

551
00:33:13,360 --> 00:33:14,960
We're not here to wipe anybody out.

552
00:33:15,800 --> 00:33:16,940
What's wrong, Tubby?

553
00:33:17,060 --> 00:33:17,500
You scared?

554
00:33:17,800 --> 00:33:19,980
Why don't you do us all a favor and go
back to bed?

555
00:33:20,280 --> 00:33:21,360
Alright, Hiyuya.

556
00:33:21,540 --> 00:33:22,840
Everybody just calm down.

557
00:33:23,729 --> 00:33:25,800
We all know what our mission is,
right?

558
00:33:29,544 --> 00:33:30,824
Look, I brought you some apples.

559
00:33:31,674 --> 00:33:32,820
You like them, right?

560
00:33:33,449 --> 00:33:34,940
Here, don't they look delicious?

561
00:33:37,820 --> 00:33:38,820
That's weird.

562
00:33:39,064 --> 00:33:41,140
I wonder where I put that knife I had
before.

563
00:33:41,644 --> 00:33:43,044
It's right in front of you, Sakura.

564
00:33:43,420 --> 00:33:44,420
Oh.

565
00:33:45,020 --> 00:33:48,780
You're so lame getting all scatterbrained
just cause you're around Sasuke.

566
00:33:48,920 --> 00:33:50,220
Why do you have to come in here on your
own?

567
00:33:50,221 --> 00:33:51,221
Naruto.

568
00:33:51,500 --> 00:33:51,960
NAN!

569
00:33:51,961 --> 00:33:52,420
RU!

570
00:33:52,540 --> 00:33:53,000
TAO!

571
00:33:53,160 --> 00:33:54,160
CHUKE!

572
00:33:54,540 --> 00:33:55,860
FUZUBAKI BORAI!

573
00:34:00,320 --> 00:34:00,780
NAN!

574
00:34:00,780 --> 00:34:00,780
RU!

575
00:34:00,780 --> 00:34:00,780
TAO!

576
00:34:00,780 --> 00:34:00,780
CHUKE!

577
00:34:00,780 --> 00:34:00,780
FUZUBAKI BORAI!

578
00:34:00,781 --> 00:34:01,360
Geez, Naruto.

579
00:34:01,620 --> 00:34:02,840
Will you knock it off already?

580
00:34:03,700 --> 00:34:04,820
KAMARING JUJU!

581
00:34:05,180 --> 00:34:06,180
Sakura.

582
00:34:07,120 --> 00:34:09,219
I swear I'll protect you.

583
00:34:10,080 --> 00:34:10,960
Okay, okay.

584
00:34:11,060 --> 00:34:12,060
Don't hit me.

585
00:34:14,100 --> 00:34:15,540
Sasuke, thank you.

586
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:19,179
I mean, you know, you protected me from
the sand, right?

587
00:34:19,600 --> 00:34:20,600
No.

588
00:34:21,179 --> 00:34:23,300
It wasn't me who rescued you.

589
00:34:24,159 --> 00:34:25,239
It was Naruto.

590
00:34:43,600 --> 00:34:45,500
You're still too weak.

591
00:34:50,340 --> 00:34:52,179
You don't have enough hate.

592
00:34:53,440 --> 00:34:54,860
And you know something?

593
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,620
You never will.

594
00:34:58,630 --> 00:34:58,940
Done.

595
00:34:59,220 --> 00:35:00,480
All peeled and ready.

596
00:35:00,600 --> 00:35:02,640
I'll cut it so it's easier to eat.

597
00:35:03,860 --> 00:35:04,480
Here!

598
00:35:04,660 --> 00:35:05,660
Wanna try one?

599
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:09,040
Ow!

600
00:35:10,180 --> 00:35:11,180
What the?

601
00:35:12,040 --> 00:35:13,040
Sasuke?

602
00:35:13,210 --> 00:35:14,460
What the heck's going on?

603
00:35:18,220 --> 00:35:19,220
You.

604
00:35:21,140 --> 00:35:22,140
Naruto.

605
00:35:22,240 --> 00:35:23,440
Yeah, I'm listening.

606
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:25,080
I want you to fight me.

607
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:26,300
Fight me now.

608
00:35:27,420 --> 00:35:27,980
What?

609
00:35:28,220 --> 00:35:29,440
We're in a hospital.

610
00:35:29,500 --> 00:35:31,560
You just got patched up by Grandma
Tsunade.

611
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:33,480
What are you talking about?

612
00:35:33,600 --> 00:35:34,620
Shut up and fight!

613
00:35:38,940 --> 00:35:41,480
Sasuke... Do you really
think you saved me?

614
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:44,000
I don't care if she's the fifth Hokage.

615
00:35:44,180 --> 00:35:46,340
You shouldn't have gotten her involved in
this.

616
00:35:46,560 --> 00:35:47,560
What?

617
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:52,600
After all, you did say you wanted to
fight.

618
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,900
Well, now it looks like you've got your
chance.

619
00:35:55,380 --> 00:35:57,860
That is, unless you've chickened out.

620
00:35:59,540 --> 00:36:00,060
Hey!

621
00:36:00,380 --> 00:36:01,400
S-Sasuke!

622
00:36:01,600 --> 00:36:02,120
Wait!

623
00:36:02,260 --> 00:36:03,260
Don't do this!

624
00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:05,100
Naruto, say something!

625
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:06,620
This is crazy!

626
00:36:10,580 --> 00:36:11,180
Sasuke!

627
00:36:11,181 --> 00:36:12,221
Actually, this is perfect!

628
00:36:12,300 --> 00:36:15,060
I was just thinking about how I wanted to
kick your butt!

629
00:36:17,220 --> 00:36:18,220
Follow me.

630
00:37:05,300 --> 00:37:06,820
What's this weird feeling?

631
00:37:07,420 --> 00:37:09,300
My lower belly's all tight!

632
00:37:09,640 --> 00:37:11,100
I wanna fight you, too.

633
00:37:13,780 --> 00:37:15,960
And... and I'm getting chills!

634
00:37:20,160 --> 00:37:21,160
Hmph.

635
00:37:21,440 --> 00:37:22,760
What's so funny?

636
00:37:22,980 --> 00:37:24,980
I'm not laughing cause it's funny!

637
00:37:25,140 --> 00:37:26,340
I'm just psyched!

638
00:37:26,740 --> 00:37:30,980
Cause I know that today is the day when I
finally beat you!

639
00:37:31,400 --> 00:37:33,980
What did you say?

640
00:37:34,180 --> 00:37:36,480
Don't talk nonsense, you inept loser!

641
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:40,520
I won't be such a loser after I win today,
will I?

642
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,440
Go away.

643
00:37:45,020 --> 00:37:47,280
You don't interest me at the moment.

644
00:37:51,340 --> 00:37:51,860
You.

645
00:37:51,861 --> 00:37:55,340
An idiot like you has no business acting
all high and mighty!

646
00:37:55,660 --> 00:37:55,980
Ha!

647
00:37:56,240 --> 00:37:58,740
What happened to the comm-controlled
Sasuke?

648
00:37:59,040 --> 00:38:00,600
Am I making you nervous?

649
00:38:00,980 --> 00:38:02,992
It looks like you picked
a fight with me and

650
00:38:02,993 --> 00:38:05,200
now you're too scared
to go through with it!

651
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:05,920
Is that it?

652
00:38:06,080 --> 00:38:07,280
Let's just do this.

653
00:38:07,560 --> 00:38:09,440
Put on your headband and we will.

654
00:38:09,740 --> 00:38:10,740
I'll wait.

655
00:38:10,840 --> 00:38:11,840
Not to worry.

656
00:38:11,940 --> 00:38:13,060
I don't need that thing.

657
00:38:13,240 --> 00:38:14,220
Just do it!

658
00:38:14,260 --> 00:38:15,260
Come on!

659
00:38:17,100 --> 00:38:18,960
There's no reason to put it on.

660
00:38:19,240 --> 00:38:22,160
Cause you won't be able to make a scratch
on my forehead.

661
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:23,440
That's not the point!

662
00:38:23,580 --> 00:38:25,850
Come on, you know
putting your headband on is a

663
00:38:25,851 --> 00:38:28,780
testament to fighting on
equal terms as a Leaf Shinobi!

664
00:38:30,440 --> 00:38:32,940
There you go, acting all high and mighty
again.

665
00:38:33,200 --> 00:38:35,420
You don't honestly believe that we're
equals.

666
00:38:35,760 --> 00:38:36,900
Heck yeah I do!

667
00:38:37,100 --> 00:38:40,920
All this time I've never once thought that
I was inferior to you in any way!

668
00:38:41,540 --> 00:38:43,040
You're a complete embarrassment!

669
00:38:43,560 --> 00:38:46,640
Only because next to me... you're
embarrassed at how weak you are!

670
00:38:46,740 --> 00:38:48,100
Isn't that right Sasuke?

671
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:49,480
Naruto!

672
00:38:50,720 --> 00:38:51,720
Sasuke!

673
00:39:18,530 --> 00:39:20,730
Don't get cocky and let your guard down!

674
00:39:27,430 --> 00:39:29,790
I've had just about enough of this!

675
00:39:40,650 --> 00:39:42,750
Multi Shadow Claw Jutsu!

676
00:40:22,910 --> 00:40:24,110
FIRE STYLE!

677
00:40:24,190 --> 00:40:25,270
FIRE BOMB JUJU!

678
00:40:31,630 --> 00:40:32,630
Oh!

679
00:40:36,300 --> 00:40:37,300
Naruto!

680
00:40:48,640 --> 00:40:49,980
How did he?

681
00:40:50,060 --> 00:40:51,460
What juju is that?

682
00:40:59,360 --> 00:41:01,200
Please, stop this!

683
00:41:01,520 --> 00:41:02,980
I'll win no matter what!

684
00:41:03,140 --> 00:41:04,920
I'm not finished with you yet!

685
00:41:05,240 --> 00:41:06,240
Stop it!

686
00:41:42,020 --> 00:41:44,320
What do you two think you're doing?

687
00:41:45,890 --> 00:41:48,780
That was a little intense for just a
sparring match, wasn't it?

688
00:41:49,145 --> 00:41:50,185
What's wrong with you two?

689
00:42:12,640 --> 00:42:13,880
What were you thinking?

690
00:42:14,080 --> 00:42:16,200
Were you really going to kill him,
Sasuke?

691
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:23,740
That Chidori... it was not the size you'd
aim at a comrade from the Leaf Village.

692
00:42:25,800 --> 00:42:28,440
When are you finally going to grow up,
Sasuke?

693
00:42:28,441 --> 00:42:31,880
Did meeting up with Itachi cause this?

694
00:43:00,520 --> 00:43:01,520
Dammit!

695
00:43:06,770 --> 00:43:09,330
Naruto... how far have you...

696
00:43:10,339 --> 00:43:13,890
I'm assuming it was you who taught him
that technique.

697
00:43:14,310 --> 00:43:17,290
I know you want to protect him from the
Akatsuki.

698
00:43:17,291 --> 00:43:20,910
But still, to entrust him with a jutsu
like that...

699
00:43:21,110 --> 00:43:23,370
After all, he could have killed Sasuke.

700
00:43:23,990 --> 00:43:25,910
Aren't you a fine one to talk?

701
00:43:26,280 --> 00:43:28,390
Teaching the Chidori to someone like
Sasuke...

702
00:43:29,180 --> 00:43:30,290
I knew he was a hothead.

703
00:43:30,430 --> 00:43:33,269
But I never imagined he'd
be willing to use a jutsu

704
00:43:33,270 --> 00:43:35,910
that powerful against a
comrade from his own village.

705
00:43:36,730 --> 00:43:41,250
To Naruto, Sasuke is a comrade and a rival
at the same time.

706
00:43:41,490 --> 00:43:45,470
In fact, it's the competition between them
that keeps him going.

707
00:43:46,230 --> 00:43:49,950
That's why he won't stand for it when
Sasuke tries to belittle him.

708
00:43:51,430 --> 00:43:54,400
He's been dogging
Sasuke's steps every inch of

709
00:43:54,401 --> 00:43:57,651
the way since their first
days at the academy.

710
00:43:57,790 --> 00:44:01,730
As far as Naruto's concerned, what you and
I think doesn't matter.

711
00:44:02,150 --> 00:44:05,770
There's only one person whose approval he
really cares about.

712
00:44:06,310 --> 00:44:07,310
Sasuke.

713
00:44:07,470 --> 00:44:10,702
On the other hand, it's hard
for Sasuke to watch Naruto's

714
00:44:10,703 --> 00:44:13,910
strength and skills develop
at such an astonishing rate.

715
00:44:13,911 --> 00:44:18,250
He's come along so fast, Sasuke must feel
like he's standing still.

716
00:44:18,680 --> 00:44:19,690
You mean revenge.

717
00:44:20,190 --> 00:44:23,570
His hatred of Itachi may be driving him on
too fast.

718
00:44:24,109 --> 00:44:26,810
Sasuke can't acknowledge Naruto's
abilities.

719
00:44:27,110 --> 00:44:31,450
He's afraid that if he does acknowledge
them, he somehow diminishes his own.

720
00:44:32,830 --> 00:44:35,990
It can be hard work maintaining a rivalry.

721
00:44:36,650 --> 00:44:38,870
Well, it's not a very healthy rivalry.

722
00:44:39,590 --> 00:44:42,170
It's time I gave somebody a talking to.

723
00:44:42,790 --> 00:44:43,430
Right.

724
00:44:43,510 --> 00:44:43,890
I'll be right back.

725
00:44:43,910 --> 00:44:45,370
I'll leave Naruto to you, then.

726
00:44:45,630 --> 00:44:47,250
Well, I have a mission.

727
00:44:47,810 --> 00:44:49,430
And then there's that Chidori business.

728
00:44:52,150 --> 00:44:53,150
Sakura.

729
00:44:54,750 --> 00:44:56,430
It'll be alright, don't you worry.

730
00:44:56,825 --> 00:44:59,170
We'll soon have them back to their old
selves again.

731
00:44:59,790 --> 00:45:00,790
Cheer up, okay?

732
00:45:02,170 --> 00:45:03,170
I'll see you soon.

733
00:45:13,020 --> 00:45:14,020
What is it, Naruto?

734
00:45:15,160 --> 00:45:16,160
Listen, Sakura.

735
00:45:19,360 --> 00:45:20,430
This is between us.

736
00:45:20,470 --> 00:45:21,470
Stay out of it.

737
00:45:50,410 --> 00:45:52,230
You're still too weak.

738
00:45:53,300 --> 00:45:54,750
You don't have enough hate.

739
00:45:55,950 --> 00:45:57,390
And you know something?

740
00:45:58,350 --> 00:45:59,550
You never will.

741
00:46:08,920 --> 00:46:11,260
I like that look in his eyes.

742
00:46:33,160 --> 00:46:38,080
I'm sorry, but I'm sorry.

743
00:46:38,081 --> 00:46:39,740
I'm testing everyone's luck.

744
00:46:40,380 --> 00:46:41,380
You know what?

745
00:46:41,500 --> 00:46:42,700
When I'm at it, I'll meet you.

746
00:46:46,270 --> 00:46:47,270
Be careful.

747
00:46:47,380 --> 00:46:48,800
Actually, I'll be here any time.

748
00:46:48,801 --> 00:46:49,120
Well, that's a good start.

749
00:46:49,121 --> 00:46:49,160
I'll leave you to it.

750
00:46:49,900 --> 00:46:50,900
What?

751
00:47:11,440 --> 00:47:12,480
Shut up!

752
00:47:12,985 --> 00:47:14,940
What makes you think you know anything
about it?

753
00:47:15,495 --> 00:47:16,640
It's easy for you to talk.

754
00:47:16,660 --> 00:47:17,780
You have no idea!

755
00:47:17,781 --> 00:47:18,781
Easy.

756
00:47:19,640 --> 00:47:20,720
Just try to calm down.

757
00:47:21,200 --> 00:47:25,060
Maybe if I was to kill the most important
people in your life, everyone who's ever

758
00:47:25,061 --> 00:47:27,920
meant anything, maybe then I'd listen to
you.

759
00:47:28,330 --> 00:47:30,740
Because maybe then you'd have some idea
how I feel!

760
00:47:31,740 --> 00:47:32,740
Hmm.

761
00:47:32,950 --> 00:47:38,281
It's an interesting theory, but I'm afraid
you're a little late to put it to the test.

762
00:47:38,790 --> 00:47:41,480
Everyone you're talking about has already
been killed.

763
00:47:43,940 --> 00:47:46,380
I've been around longer than you have,
kid.

764
00:47:46,381 --> 00:47:49,020
And I've seen my share of troubles.

765
00:47:49,980 --> 00:47:53,700
You're not the only one who knows what
it's like to lose somebody.

766
00:47:57,120 --> 00:48:02,280
So, it looks like neither of us has led a
charmed life exactly, have we?

767
00:48:03,960 --> 00:48:06,120
Still, we're not all that bad off.

768
00:48:07,120 --> 00:48:12,561
At least you and I have been lucky enough
to find new comrades to help fill the void.

769
00:48:16,000 --> 00:48:18,380
Anyway... I do
know how you feel.

770
00:48:19,700 --> 00:48:23,540
With the Chidori, you've been granted a
gift of awesome power.

771
00:48:24,680 --> 00:48:29,200
It's not a power to be used against your
comrades, or to seek vengeance.

772
00:48:30,240 --> 00:48:34,180
I think, in your heart of hearts,
you know what it's for.

773
00:48:34,640 --> 00:48:36,340
Okay, end of lecture.

774
00:48:36,800 --> 00:48:39,660
You decide whether what I'm saying hits
the mark or not.

775
00:48:46,125 --> 00:48:47,460
The one with him is Kakashi.

776
00:48:47,640 --> 00:48:48,620
I've heard about him.

777
00:48:48,621 --> 00:48:51,080
We'd better hold off for a bit.

778
00:48:51,570 --> 00:48:54,480
Well, if you're so scared of him,
why don't I just go in by myself?

779
00:48:54,740 --> 00:48:56,060
He doesn't look that tough to me.

780
00:48:56,720 --> 00:48:57,720
I'm with you.

781
00:48:58,420 --> 00:49:00,860
I bet the two of us could tear that Leaf
Shinobi apart.

782
00:49:01,685 --> 00:49:03,460
Did I sound like I wanted your help?

783
00:49:03,840 --> 00:49:04,840
Butt out, birdbrain!

784
00:49:06,290 --> 00:49:08,420
Man, it's no wonder you never had a
boyfriend.

785
00:49:08,620 --> 00:49:10,220
You're such a-Shut it, fatso!

786
00:50:00,840 --> 00:50:04,281
Just the two of us...
What is he, a... ...a...

787
00:50:05,794 --> 00:50:07,320
...a...

788
00:50:11,340 --> 00:50:15,380
...a... ...a...

789
00:50:23,280 --> 00:50:24,680
...a...

790
00:50:41,769 --> 00:50:44,770
...a little goodbye?

791
00:50:52,610 --> 00:50:53,610
Let's go back.

792
00:50:53,910 --> 00:50:54,910
Alright.

793
00:50:55,930 --> 00:50:57,290
We both made it.

794
00:50:57,450 --> 00:50:59,650
We climbed all the way up to the top.

795
00:51:17,540 --> 00:51:18,810
What's wrong, Sakura?

796
00:51:19,730 --> 00:51:22,110
Look, there's something I need to talk to
you about, Naruto.

797
00:51:22,250 --> 00:51:25,551
So if you still want that date
you've always wanted... Huh?

798
00:51:44,600 --> 00:51:45,820
What do I do?

799
00:51:49,340 --> 00:51:50,340
Dammit!

800
00:51:51,260 --> 00:51:52,260
Dammit!

801
00:51:56,800 --> 00:51:58,540
We are the Sound Ninja Four.

802
00:51:59,030 --> 00:52:01,340
We're here on orders from Lord Orochimaru.

803
00:52:01,610 --> 00:52:03,940
You guys might want to think twice about
doing this.

804
00:52:04,220 --> 00:52:07,040
Because I'm in a really bad mood right
now.

805
00:52:11,080 --> 00:52:14,140
Oh, just stop all of your prattling,
you little weakling.

806
00:52:15,140 --> 00:52:16,480
Did he call me weak?

807
00:52:17,845 --> 00:52:18,845
Come on, kid.

808
00:52:19,070 --> 00:52:22,360
I want to play do-re-mi on those ribs of
yours till they crack!

809
00:52:25,490 --> 00:52:26,490
What?

810
00:52:26,875 --> 00:52:29,490
Orochimaru left a curse mark on Sasuke's
body?

811
00:52:29,850 --> 00:52:30,850
Yeah.

812
00:52:31,410 --> 00:52:35,470
And he said Sasuke would come looking for
him, hoping to find more power.

813
00:52:36,210 --> 00:52:37,210
I see.

814
00:52:37,910 --> 00:52:39,350
I didn't realize that had happened.

815
00:52:41,439 --> 00:52:42,450
Orochimaru, huh?

816
00:52:43,660 --> 00:52:45,670
Yeah, I ran into him not too long ago.

817
00:52:45,910 --> 00:52:46,910
You did?

818
00:52:47,770 --> 00:52:49,010
He was incredibly powerful.

819
00:52:49,950 --> 00:52:51,130
Guy is bad news.

820
00:52:54,040 --> 00:52:55,750
Come on, everything will be fine.

821
00:52:57,380 --> 00:53:00,390
Sasuke would never let a guy like that
sink his claws into him.

822
00:53:00,940 --> 00:53:02,270
He's already a powerhouse.

823
00:53:02,530 --> 00:53:04,870
It's not like he needs that kind of help,
you know.

824
00:53:05,110 --> 00:53:05,390
Ah!

825
00:53:05,950 --> 00:53:06,350
Ah!

826
00:53:06,930 --> 00:53:07,450
Ah!

827
00:53:07,950 --> 00:53:08,110
Ah!

828
00:53:08,450 --> 00:53:09,450
Ah!

829
00:53:10,190 --> 00:53:11,730
You should come with us.

830
00:53:12,130 --> 00:53:14,510
Lord Orochimaru offers you power.

831
00:53:14,950 --> 00:53:17,090
What is your purpose in this life?

832
00:53:17,270 --> 00:53:21,650
To stay here in this backwater village,
hiding with your little friends?

833
00:53:22,510 --> 00:53:26,590
Surely you haven't forgotten, Itachi
Uchiha?

834
00:53:28,350 --> 00:53:30,130
Don't lose sight of your purpose.

835
00:53:30,710 --> 00:53:33,770
Life in this village is little more than
bondage for you.

836
00:53:34,290 --> 00:53:37,930
So sever your ties and leave this pathetic
place.

837
00:53:38,970 --> 00:53:43,490
If you can do that, there will be no limit
to the power you can wield.

838
00:53:46,310 --> 00:53:47,650
Remember your purpose!

839
00:54:50,025 --> 00:54:51,185
It's the middle of the night.

840
00:54:52,120 --> 00:54:53,610
What are you hanging around here for?

841
00:54:55,750 --> 00:54:58,090
This is the only road out of the village.

842
00:55:00,655 --> 00:55:01,910
You should go to bed.

843
00:55:16,565 --> 00:55:17,565
Why, Sasuke?

844
00:55:19,330 --> 00:55:20,850
Why won't you ever tell me anything?

845
00:55:22,575 --> 00:55:24,730
Why is it always silence with you?

846
00:55:25,500 --> 00:55:27,170
You've never shared a single thing with
me!

847
00:55:27,171 --> 00:55:28,970
Why should I have to tell you anything?

848
00:55:32,400 --> 00:55:34,370
Just keep your nose out of my business.

849
00:55:35,640 --> 00:55:36,750
It's none of your concern.

850
00:55:40,790 --> 00:55:41,830
I know you hate me.

851
00:55:43,150 --> 00:55:45,290
Even in the beginning you could never
stand me.

852
00:55:49,430 --> 00:55:49,910
Remember?

853
00:55:49,911 --> 00:55:53,670
Back when we made Ginnine and we were
assigned to our three-man squads?

854
00:55:56,150 --> 00:55:57,150
Yeah, sure.

855
00:55:57,510 --> 00:55:59,950
I mean, it was so long ago, right?

856
00:56:01,370 --> 00:56:03,670
But still, that's the day when it all
began.

857
00:56:04,070 --> 00:56:05,810
It was the start of you and me.

858
00:56:06,870 --> 00:56:07,870
And Naruto.

859
00:56:08,390 --> 00:56:10,190
And Kakashi-sensei.

860
00:56:32,780 --> 00:56:35,220
The four of us started going on missions.

861
00:56:36,500 --> 00:56:38,220
It was rough back then.

862
00:56:39,140 --> 00:56:41,060
Every day was such a challenge.

863
00:56:51,020 --> 00:56:52,780
More than anything...

864
00:57:03,400 --> 00:57:04,980
It was so much fun!

865
00:57:12,260 --> 00:57:14,840
I know about your clan, Sasuke.

866
00:57:15,160 --> 00:57:16,000
I do.

867
00:57:16,001 --> 00:57:18,060
But seeking revenge...

868
00:57:20,300 --> 00:57:22,520
That won't bring anyone happiness.

869
00:57:23,400 --> 00:57:24,660
Nobody at all.

870
00:57:26,120 --> 00:57:27,140
Not you.

871
00:57:29,180 --> 00:57:30,460
And not me.

872
00:57:33,720 --> 00:57:35,020
I knew it.

873
00:57:38,400 --> 00:57:40,120
I'm not the same as you.

874
00:57:40,700 --> 00:57:43,980
I'm traveling a path the rest of you can't
follow.

875
00:57:43,981 --> 00:57:47,480
I know that the four of us have worked
together.

876
00:57:48,200 --> 00:57:51,320
And for a while, I thought I could take
that road instead.

877
00:57:52,520 --> 00:57:56,000
But in the end, I've decided on revenge.

878
00:57:59,170 --> 00:58:01,460
That's always been my reason for living.

879
00:58:05,170 --> 00:58:06,800
I'll never be like you and Naruto.

880
00:58:07,555 --> 00:58:09,020
Don't do this, Sasuke!

881
00:58:09,120 --> 00:58:10,200
You don't have to be alone!

882
00:58:10,500 --> 00:58:13,960
You told me that day how painful a thing
solitude can be.

883
00:58:13,961 --> 00:58:17,720
I understand that pain now.

884
00:58:19,160 --> 00:58:20,700
I have a family.

885
00:58:21,140 --> 00:58:22,220
And friends.

886
00:58:23,840 --> 00:58:26,240
But... if you were gone, Sasuke...

887
00:58:27,060 --> 00:58:29,200
It would be the same thing for me.

888
00:58:29,960 --> 00:58:31,500
As being all alone.

889
00:58:38,250 --> 00:58:39,560
This is a new beginning.

890
00:58:40,360 --> 00:58:43,260
Each of us has a new path lying before us.

891
00:58:44,220 --> 00:58:45,220
Sasuke!

892
00:58:45,500 --> 00:58:48,480
I'm so in love with you, I can't even
stand it!

893
00:58:49,080 --> 00:58:51,160
If you would only be with me!

894
00:58:51,340 --> 00:58:54,320
I promise, I'd never let you regret it!

895
00:58:54,700 --> 00:58:56,220
Every day will be a joy!

896
00:58:56,460 --> 00:58:58,320
I can give you happiness!

897
00:58:59,700 --> 00:59:01,540
I'll do anything for you, Sasuke!

898
00:59:02,040 --> 00:59:03,040
So please!

899
00:59:04,249 --> 00:59:06,460
I'm begging you, don't walk away!

900
00:59:07,640 --> 00:59:09,480
I'll even help get your revenge!

901
00:59:09,860 --> 00:59:12,480
I'll do whatever it takes to make it
happen, I swear!

902
00:59:17,020 --> 00:59:26,100
So stay here... with me... and if you
can't... then take me with you, Sasuke!

903
00:59:32,940 --> 00:59:34,790
You haven't changed.

904
00:59:35,405 --> 00:59:36,790
You're still annoying.

905
00:59:40,665 --> 00:59:41,665
Don't leave me!

906
00:59:42,620 --> 00:59:45,540
If you go, I'll scream and...

907
00:59:52,080 --> 00:59:53,080
Sakura...

908
00:59:55,270 --> 00:59:56,270
Thank you for everything.

909
01:00:02,640 --> 01:00:03,640
Sasuke...

910
01:00:19,370 --> 01:00:21,110
We've been waiting for you, Sasuke.

911
01:00:24,080 --> 01:00:25,830
So what's with the change in attitude?

912
01:00:26,790 --> 01:00:30,450
It had already been decided that the
moment you abandoned the village,

913
01:00:30,710 --> 01:00:32,810
you would become our new leader.

914
01:00:33,870 --> 01:00:36,910
Please forgive the rudeness we displayed
earlier.

915
01:00:38,390 --> 01:00:39,390
Hmph.

916
01:00:41,790 --> 01:00:42,630
Now I'll ask you some questions.

917
01:00:42,631 --> 01:00:43,631
I don't care about that.

918
01:00:46,130 --> 01:00:51,330
I won't let you go to a fool's abode.

919
01:00:51,331 --> 01:00:52,351
Sasuke... I will help you.

920
01:00:57,890 --> 01:00:58,450
Okay!

921
01:00:58,710 --> 01:00:59,710
I'll be careful.

922
01:01:10,340 --> 01:01:10,900
Sasuke...

923
01:01:11,250 --> 01:01:12,720
She forgot these papers.

924
01:01:12,760 --> 01:01:13,920
She should go get them.

925
01:01:14,150 --> 01:01:19,960
What is it?

926
01:01:24,450 --> 01:01:25,450
Hey, wake up.

927
01:01:25,650 --> 01:01:27,610
You're gonna catch a cold if you sleep out
here.

928
01:01:30,070 --> 01:01:31,110
No... No...

929
01:01:33,560 --> 01:01:34,560
Sasuke, no!

930
01:01:38,560 --> 01:01:39,680
What did you say?

931
01:01:40,340 --> 01:01:41,400
Are you sure of that?

932
01:01:41,740 --> 01:01:42,740
Yes.

933
01:01:42,860 --> 01:01:44,780
We heard this from Sakura herself.

934
01:01:44,781 --> 01:01:47,320
There's no reason to doubt what she told
us.

935
01:01:50,960 --> 01:01:53,000
So that's what that wretch is after.

936
01:01:53,360 --> 01:01:55,320
He's going for the Uchiha's powers.

937
01:02:00,069 --> 01:02:01,130
Izumo, Kotetsu.

938
01:02:01,930 --> 01:02:03,630
There's somebody that I need to see.

939
01:02:06,350 --> 01:02:08,710
Would you hurry up and eat, Shikamaru?

940
01:02:08,830 --> 01:02:11,230
Your dad has an important mission to get
to.

941
01:02:11,330 --> 01:02:14,250
If you just sit there, he won't have time
for morning training.

942
01:02:15,110 --> 01:02:16,110
Yeah, yeah...

943
01:02:16,580 --> 01:02:17,580
Don't talk, just eat!

944
01:02:18,255 --> 01:02:21,490
From the second I get up, it's nag,
nag, nag.

945
01:02:23,140 --> 01:02:26,210
Now who would be visiting us so early in
the morning?

946
01:02:29,200 --> 01:02:30,200
Hey, Dad.

947
01:02:30,590 --> 01:02:31,590
What is it?

948
01:02:32,130 --> 01:02:34,970
What on earth made you want to marry such
a crabby woman like Mom?

949
01:02:37,360 --> 01:02:38,360
That's a good question.

950
01:02:39,680 --> 01:02:42,190
Even a crab like your mom can be gentle
sometimes.

951
01:02:43,420 --> 01:02:44,420
She has her moments.

952
01:02:46,654 --> 01:02:47,654
No...

953
01:02:48,640 --> 01:02:49,640
That's the reason?

954
01:02:52,310 --> 01:02:53,310
Shikamaru!

955
01:02:53,805 --> 01:02:56,830
Lady Hokage has sent a messenger to see
you.

956
01:02:57,580 --> 01:03:05,010
Late last night, Sasuke Uchiha left the
Hidden Leaf Village.

957
01:03:05,330 --> 01:03:06,330
Huh?

958
01:03:07,140 --> 01:03:10,810
And... we're quite certain he's headed for
the Hidden Sound Village.

959
01:03:11,200 --> 01:03:12,200
He just left?

960
01:03:12,825 --> 01:03:13,825
How could this happen?

961
01:03:14,310 --> 01:03:15,310
Simple.

962
01:03:15,610 --> 01:03:17,470
Orochimaru must have him in his clutches.

963
01:03:17,910 --> 01:03:17,950
Huh?

964
01:03:18,930 --> 01:03:19,410
What?

965
01:03:19,570 --> 01:03:19,990
Wait!

966
01:03:20,270 --> 01:03:21,750
That doesn't make any sense.

967
01:03:22,190 --> 01:03:26,630
What does Sasuke have to gain by talking
to someone as depraved as Orochimaru?

968
01:03:26,930 --> 01:03:29,050
At this point, his motive doesn't matter.

969
01:03:29,250 --> 01:03:30,930
We need to deal with it quickly.

970
01:03:31,830 --> 01:03:33,763
I've decided it's time
for you to carry out

971
01:03:33,863 --> 01:03:36,570
your first mission as
a Chunin, Shikamaru.

972
01:03:36,670 --> 01:03:39,150
So all I gotta do is bring Sasuke back?

973
01:03:40,240 --> 01:03:44,210
As long as none of our enemies are with
him, it shouldn't be that big a deal.

974
01:03:44,211 --> 01:03:46,730
Yes, that's your mission.

975
01:03:47,030 --> 01:03:49,190
But it must be accomplished without delay.

976
01:03:49,650 --> 01:03:52,910
And you may find it a more dangerous task
than you think.

977
01:03:53,150 --> 01:03:54,150
Huh?

978
01:03:54,830 --> 01:03:59,270
There's a strong possibility that Sasuke
is being guarded by Orochimaru's men.

979
01:04:00,190 --> 01:04:00,710
Damn.

980
01:04:01,090 --> 01:04:03,550
This is gonna be a real pain in the ass.

981
01:04:04,030 --> 01:04:05,910
What happened to Sasuke anyway?

982
01:04:06,250 --> 01:04:09,350
I used to look up to him and now he's
joined up with the bad guys.

983
01:04:09,570 --> 01:04:10,890
This really stinks.

984
01:04:12,010 --> 01:04:15,597
Well, if we're gonna be facing
opposition, I'm gonna need

985
01:04:15,598 --> 01:04:19,410
to request a team composed
exclusively of Jonin and Chunin.

986
01:04:20,710 --> 01:04:22,470
I can't honor that request.

987
01:04:22,890 --> 01:04:23,230
What?

988
01:04:23,410 --> 01:04:24,410
And why not?

989
01:04:24,650 --> 01:04:26,070
You already know the answer.

990
01:04:27,930 --> 01:04:31,890
As I'm sure you're aware, most of the
Jonin have been sent out on missions.

991
01:04:32,230 --> 01:04:35,250
Only a handful stayed behind to defend in
case of attack.

992
01:04:39,350 --> 01:04:42,420
Go round up any skilled Genin you feel are
up to the job.

993
01:04:42,421 --> 01:04:42,820
Go round up any skilled Genin you feel are
up to the job.

994
01:04:43,040 --> 01:04:44,820
You have 30 minutes to leave this village.

995
01:04:50,600 --> 01:04:51,600
Hold on.

996
01:04:52,240 --> 01:04:55,000
There is one person I strongly recommend
you include.

997
01:04:55,490 --> 01:04:56,490
No way!

998
01:04:56,780 --> 01:04:57,940
You gotta be kidding!

999
01:04:59,480 --> 01:05:02,800
You just woke up, and you're already this
annoying?

1000
01:05:03,905 --> 01:05:05,620
Why'd she want me to bring this guy?

1001
01:05:09,880 --> 01:05:11,420
Sasuke, you jerk!

1002
01:05:12,760 --> 01:05:14,520
Hey, hold on a second!

1003
01:05:14,720 --> 01:05:15,720
I'll go get dressed!

1004
01:05:17,220 --> 01:05:18,220
Hmm...

1005
01:05:20,120 --> 01:05:24,720
So, uh, besides me, have you come up with
any other top-notch guys to ask?

1006
01:05:24,920 --> 01:05:25,920
A few.

1007
01:05:27,620 --> 01:05:29,020
Wake up, will ya?

1008
01:05:29,300 --> 01:05:31,920
You said top-notch guys, right?

1009
01:05:33,180 --> 01:05:34,760
Plan B, I guess.

1010
01:05:37,520 --> 01:05:39,800
Wait, Plan B is potato chips?

1011
01:05:40,960 --> 01:05:42,360
They're barbecue flavor.

1012
01:05:42,640 --> 01:05:44,120
Feel free to help out.

1013
01:05:47,100 --> 01:05:48,100
Hmm...

1014
01:05:51,000 --> 01:05:52,000
Now.

1015
01:05:57,500 --> 01:06:01,760
Even for a bag of potato chips,
I refuse to let anyone have the last bite!

1016
01:06:03,860 --> 01:06:06,920
Choji and I have been on the same team for
a long time.

1017
01:06:07,260 --> 01:06:10,160
We work well together, so asking him's a
no-brainer.

1018
01:06:11,560 --> 01:06:12,680
I get it!

1019
01:06:12,681 --> 01:06:13,340
You know him!

1020
01:06:13,480 --> 01:06:14,943
But for this kind of
thing, don't you think

1021
01:06:14,944 --> 01:06:17,000
your first choice should
be someone like Shino?

1022
01:06:17,001 --> 01:06:19,280
Man, you always have to yell.

1023
01:06:26,300 --> 01:06:28,280
Not on your life!

1024
01:06:37,740 --> 01:06:39,280
Shino can't do it.

1025
01:06:39,320 --> 01:06:42,540
He's off on some special mission with his
father right now.

1026
01:06:42,960 --> 01:06:43,960
Hey, wait!

1027
01:06:44,120 --> 01:06:45,160
Not them, too!

1028
01:06:45,161 --> 01:06:46,760
Yep, they're on the team.

1029
01:06:50,560 --> 01:06:51,560
I see.

1030
01:06:51,860 --> 01:06:53,440
Sounds like an interesting job.

1031
01:06:53,800 --> 01:06:56,760
I guess getting up early to walk the dogs
pays off sometimes.

1032
01:06:57,840 --> 01:06:59,780
Hey, Shikamaru, is there anybody else?

1033
01:07:00,140 --> 01:07:03,460
I wish we had time to find some more guys,
but we're late already.

1034
01:07:04,400 --> 01:07:06,468
If we don't run across
anybody else on our way

1035
01:07:06,469 --> 01:07:09,341
out of the village, I
suppose it'll just be us.

1036
01:07:11,680 --> 01:07:12,520
Yes, I understand.

1037
01:07:12,521 --> 01:07:17,800
Yeah, it's kind of a drag, but I figure
the more guys we have, the better, so...

1038
01:07:20,960 --> 01:07:23,760
Why now, of all times...

1039
01:07:26,640 --> 01:07:28,240
Lee, it's up to you.

1040
01:07:28,360 --> 01:07:29,960
You do what you must do.

1041
01:07:33,420 --> 01:07:34,420
All right!

1042
01:07:34,960 --> 01:07:35,960
Come on!

1043
01:07:36,300 --> 01:07:37,380
Let's get going, everybody!

1044
01:07:37,520 --> 01:07:38,520
Follow me!

1045
01:07:39,480 --> 01:07:41,080
Um... Hey, Naruto.

1046
01:07:42,305 --> 01:07:44,740
I'm kind of supposed to be the platoon
leader here.

1047
01:07:45,050 --> 01:07:46,520
I know it's a drag, but...

1048
01:07:47,600 --> 01:07:50,160
You really think you're the best person to
direct this operation?

1049
01:07:50,860 --> 01:07:52,580
You don't seem very reliable to me.

1050
01:07:53,634 --> 01:07:56,720
What's up with you acting like you're in
charge all of a sudden, Naruto?

1051
01:07:57,400 --> 01:08:00,031
I mean, taking orders
from somebody as lazy as

1052
01:08:00,032 --> 01:08:03,480
Shikamaru doesn't exactly
thrill me either, but still...

1053
01:08:04,880 --> 01:08:07,445
But none of you get to
decide who's the leader here,

1054
01:08:07,446 --> 01:08:10,020
because Shikamaru is the
only one of us who's a Chunin.

1055
01:08:10,770 --> 01:08:13,150
That means the elders of
the village clearly believe

1056
01:08:13,151 --> 01:08:15,420
he's got what it takes to
call the shots on this one.

1057
01:08:16,720 --> 01:08:21,661
If that's the case, then perhaps you should
start coming up with some sort of a plan.

1058
01:08:21,700 --> 01:08:23,596
From what I heard,
Sasuke's gone to the enemy,

1059
01:08:23,597 --> 01:08:26,001
and there's a real chance
they could ambush us.

1060
01:08:26,555 --> 01:08:29,094
Well, for starters, this
is a rescue operation,

1061
01:08:29,095 --> 01:08:31,000
so we'll be in the
position of pursuit.

1062
01:08:31,650 --> 01:08:35,420
Which means the enemy already has an
important advantage over us.

1063
01:08:35,965 --> 01:08:40,000
That said, I'm arranging us in a deployment
formation that can respond to the enemy.

1064
01:08:40,001 --> 01:08:46,779
If any of you don't follow my exact
orders, we're all gonna die.

1065
01:08:50,200 --> 01:08:52,600
Okay, we'll go with a single-file strike
formation.

1066
01:08:53,570 --> 01:08:58,140
As we all know, the most important position
is the spearhead, so that's gonna be...

1067
01:08:58,141 --> 01:09:00,200
Kiba, you're up front.

1068
01:09:01,740 --> 01:09:04,627
With all the walks you
and Akamaru go on, you're

1069
01:09:04,628 --> 01:09:07,721
the most familiar with
the Land of Fire's terrain.

1070
01:09:07,899 --> 01:09:09,979
And with that sensitive nose of yours...

1071
01:09:10,000 --> 01:09:12,680
You'll be able to track
Sasuke's scent, while

1072
01:09:12,681 --> 01:09:15,521
sniffing out any booby
traps the enemy may have set.

1073
01:09:15,960 --> 01:09:20,200
Moreover, because we'll have two sets of
eyes up front, you and Akamaru will be

1074
01:09:20,201 --> 01:09:23,220
more effective in protecting our
single-file line from an assault.

1075
01:09:25,640 --> 01:09:28,700
Second in line will be yours truly,
Platoon Leader.

1076
01:09:28,859 --> 01:09:31,299
From that position,
I'll be able to direct

1077
01:09:31,300 --> 01:09:33,720
everyone behind me
using silent hand signals.

1078
01:09:33,939 --> 01:09:37,979
And because I'm so close to Kiba, I'll
be in position to react to any situation.

1079
01:09:37,980 --> 01:09:41,680
In the middle, the number three position
is Naruto.

1080
01:09:43,340 --> 01:09:47,000
The middle of the line is the perfect
location for you because you're the most

1081
01:09:47,001 --> 01:09:50,819
capable of executing quick moves either in
front of you or behind you.

1082
01:09:51,359 --> 01:09:54,880
You're the cornerstone, and you have the
Shadow Clone Jutsu.

1083
01:09:56,360 --> 01:09:58,260
Fourth in line is Choji.

1084
01:09:59,480 --> 01:10:01,942
Choji, you might not
have any speed, but your

1085
01:10:01,943 --> 01:10:04,701
striking power is the greatest
of the Platoon members.

1086
01:10:05,340 --> 01:10:07,960
Kiba, myself, and Naruto will launch a
surprise attack.

1087
01:10:07,980 --> 01:10:10,680
Then you'll swoop in and finish him off.

1088
01:10:10,880 --> 01:10:12,620
You're the second wave of our assault.

1089
01:10:13,760 --> 01:10:16,140
Finally, on the end will be you,
Neji.

1090
01:10:16,380 --> 01:10:18,220
Your position is most difficult.

1091
01:10:18,560 --> 01:10:19,560
Rear lookout.

1092
01:10:19,620 --> 01:10:24,621
I want you to use your Byakugan to constantly
scan ahead for weakness in our ranks.

1093
01:10:25,580 --> 01:10:26,700
Got it?

1094
01:10:26,960 --> 01:10:28,440
Then take a look at this.

1095
01:10:33,740 --> 01:10:37,660
This diagram shows exactly what part of
the perimeter you're responsible for.

1096
01:10:38,620 --> 01:10:39,980
Kiba watches the front.

1097
01:10:40,260 --> 01:10:42,600
I'm responsible for a wider forward view.

1098
01:10:43,540 --> 01:10:44,720
Naruto's got the left.

1099
01:10:45,060 --> 01:10:46,060
Choji, the right.

1100
01:10:46,590 --> 01:10:51,400
And Neji, using your Byakugan,
you cover the entire area to the rear.

1101
01:10:52,639 --> 01:10:56,720
Alright, now I think I should familiarize
myself with our arms and weaponry.

1102
01:10:57,060 --> 01:10:59,104
I'll need to check out
all of the ninja tools

1103
01:10:59,105 --> 01:11:00,880
each of you plan on
carrying into battle.

1104
01:11:01,020 --> 01:11:02,600
That way I'll know what we have.

1105
01:11:03,660 --> 01:11:04,840
Are there any questions?

1106
01:11:08,360 --> 01:11:10,700
Even though he has just
assembled this team, he has

1107
01:11:10,701 --> 01:11:13,360
already created the best
possible formation for them.

1108
01:11:14,750 --> 01:11:18,660
Since no one has anything to add,
I save the most important thing for last.

1109
01:11:19,710 --> 01:11:23,380
For as long as I've known him, Sasuke
and I haven't exactly been close buddies.

1110
01:11:23,780 --> 01:11:25,720
In fact, I don't really like him at all.

1111
01:11:26,320 --> 01:11:34,320
All the same, Sasuke's a ninja belonging
to the Hidden Leaf Village.

1112
01:11:34,840 --> 01:11:35,900
He's a comrade.

1113
01:11:35,901 --> 01:11:38,700
And I'll put my life on the line to help
him.

1114
01:11:39,400 --> 01:11:40,880
That's the way of our village.

1115
01:11:41,720 --> 01:11:44,460
I know I usually seem like a pretty lazy
guy.

1116
01:11:45,320 --> 01:11:46,340
But not today.

1117
01:11:47,980 --> 01:11:50,640
Because now I'm responsible for your
lives, too.

1118
01:11:55,320 --> 01:11:58,860
Wow, I never thought I'd see Shikamaru
acting like a Chunin.

1119
01:11:59,060 --> 01:12:00,060
Very impressive.

1120
01:12:02,320 --> 01:12:04,980
Okay, as soon as we check our gear,
we'll go.

1121
01:12:05,900 --> 01:12:06,900
Show me your weapons.

1122
01:12:16,500 --> 01:12:20,060
Sasuke would never let a guy like that
sink his claws into him.

1123
01:12:20,500 --> 01:12:22,720
I mean, he's already a total powerhouse.

1124
01:12:22,820 --> 01:12:25,080
It's not like he needs that kind of help,
you know.

1125
01:12:26,260 --> 01:12:26,960
Don't worry.

1126
01:12:27,220 --> 01:12:28,460
I guarantee it.

1127
01:12:30,800 --> 01:12:31,280
Dammit.

1128
01:12:31,281 --> 01:12:32,660
Why, Sasuke?

1129
01:12:32,661 --> 01:12:34,800
All right.

1130
01:12:35,200 --> 01:12:36,200
Let's move out.

1131
01:12:36,300 --> 01:12:37,300
Wait!

1132
01:12:42,920 --> 01:12:43,920
Are you all right?

1133
01:12:45,460 --> 01:12:46,850
Lady Hokage told me everything.

1134
01:12:47,290 --> 01:12:48,290
Sorry, Sakura.

1135
01:12:48,500 --> 01:12:49,820
I can't take you on this mission.

1136
01:12:51,950 --> 01:12:52,950
I know you tried.

1137
01:12:53,390 --> 01:12:55,530
But even you couldn't convince Sasuke,
could you?

1138
01:12:57,430 --> 01:13:01,110
Now our only option is for me to find him
and force him to come back to the village.

1139
01:13:01,870 --> 01:13:02,870
I'm sorry.

1140
01:13:03,570 --> 01:13:05,390
But there's nothing else you can do for
him.

1141
01:13:09,290 --> 01:13:09,930
I'm sorry.

1142
01:13:09,931 --> 01:13:10,931
Naruto...

1143
01:13:11,290 --> 01:13:14,650
This is a... once-in-a-lifetime request.

1144
01:13:15,810 --> 01:13:17,370
Just bring him home.

1145
01:13:18,460 --> 01:13:20,290
Please bring Sasuke back to me.

1146
01:13:21,930 --> 01:13:23,930
I did everything I could.

1147
01:13:24,790 --> 01:13:29,090
I tried, but I couldn't stop him from
leaving the village.

1148
01:13:30,430 --> 01:13:34,250
At this point, there's only one person who
can stop him.

1149
01:13:35,090 --> 01:13:36,710
Only one who can save him.

1150
01:13:37,690 --> 01:13:40,590
Naruto, it's all up to you.

1151
01:13:50,890 --> 01:13:52,190
Oh gosh, Sakura.

1152
01:13:52,390 --> 01:13:54,310
You must really care about Sasuke,
huh?

1153
01:13:56,030 --> 01:13:57,030
I get it.

1154
01:13:57,110 --> 01:14:00,290
I can see that deep down this must be
really painful for you.

1155
01:14:00,590 --> 01:14:02,250
I know you must be suffering.

1156
01:14:07,470 --> 01:14:09,610
Sakura, I want to ask you something.

1157
01:14:10,259 --> 01:14:11,259
Huh?

1158
01:14:12,950 --> 01:14:14,690
Naruto, what do you think of him?

1159
01:14:17,000 --> 01:14:19,710
He knows about my feelings and he
purposely gets in the way.

1160
01:14:19,850 --> 01:14:22,990
It's almost like he enjoys interfering and
making me feel bad.

1161
01:14:23,670 --> 01:14:27,170
Despite what he says, he doesn't
understand one single thing about me.

1162
01:14:27,410 --> 01:14:28,410
He's just annoying.

1163
01:14:42,290 --> 01:14:44,490
Naruto, thank you so much.

1164
01:14:46,230 --> 01:14:47,670
Don't you worry one bit!

1165
01:14:47,790 --> 01:14:49,110
I'm gonna bring Sasuke back!

1166
01:14:49,450 --> 01:14:51,730
I promise that on my life, Sakura!

1167
01:14:55,230 --> 01:14:59,950
More than anyone else, you always
understood me.

1168
01:15:00,290 --> 01:15:04,350
You've always been there when I needed
help.

1169
01:15:06,550 --> 01:15:07,550
Naruto...

1170
01:15:12,610 --> 01:15:13,490
was normally the one who never needed your
help.

1171
01:15:13,490 --> 01:15:13,490
Whoa!

1172
01:15:13,491 --> 01:15:14,491
Honda Naruto!

1173
01:15:14,870 --> 01:15:15,990
That's quite an insult.

1174
01:15:16,270 --> 01:15:18,690
Are you sure you can promise her that we
will save him?!

1175
01:15:18,691 --> 01:15:18,890
Sure!

1176
01:15:19,290 --> 01:15:23,230
When I ask for this, you can count on me,
I'm on budget for the ninja way!

1177
01:15:23,810 --> 01:15:24,810
Well, come on!

1178
01:15:25,010 --> 01:15:27,006
I'll come to you and solve it when I
finish my adjustment, come along!

1179
01:15:27,030 --> 01:15:27,250
Huh?

1180
01:15:27,590 --> 01:15:32,550
Hey, theнимu... Right!

1181
01:16:45,550 --> 01:16:47,450
A little pause... and we are back.

1182
01:16:59,970 --> 01:17:07,970
A little pause... and we are back.

